  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have,\r\n$|B|=64$\r\n$\\Rightarrow |\\operatorname{adj} A \\mid=64$\r\n$\\Rightarrow|A|^{2}=64$\r\n$|A|=\\pm 8$",
